#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the &ksnake; configuration dialog to change &ksnake; settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>General</guilabel> tab you can set the speed of snakes, "
"choose the number of snakes and balls and their behaviour."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a background color or an image on the <guilabel>Appearance</guilabel> "
"tab."
